-- CIDM-11655 HCDM Information missing in person > Health > medication including Psychotropic
/*
-- Issue Description: 
   Person Psychotropic Medication records missing HCDM Information 

	Root Cause: Application Code Issue
		This issue occurs during the following scenario:
		1.  The user navigates away from the edit screen of an existing record.
		2.  The user then attempts to create a new psychotropic medication record.
		During this process, the HCDM ID is incorrectly patched from the UI, which updates the values of the old record instead of creating new data. As a result, no HCDM data is created for the latest record.
		
	Fix Provided: Data fix has been provided to update the missing HCDM information. 
			      This update utilizes the court order or the most recent psychotropic medication HCDM information.
	Regression Impacts: Validated as a part of code fix.
	Is Code fix Required?: (Yes/No) Yes
		Code fix ticket#: (If Yes) CIDM-11610
*/


-- Update using Court Order HCDM Data



-- Update using most recent medication HCDM Data


